 "commanders": [
  "Norman Osborn // Green Goblin"
 ],
 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Norman Osborn: Sinister Six",
 "notes": [
  "v3, Oct 17, 2026: tuned for power for the family Sinister Six deck. Built from the full card pool, no wheels, not checked against your collection. Doctor Doom, King of Latveria is in the 99.",
  "Game Changers (3): Opposition Agent (already in the current deck, Agent Venom art), Orcish Bowmasters, The One Ring. Rhystic Study was cut for Opposition Agent.",
  "Plan: Norman on turn 2 (unblockable, connives on hit; Mask of the Schemer makes him connive X). Transform for {1}{U}{B}{R}. Green Goblin lets you recast any nonland card you discarded this turn for its mana cost, 2 less. Discard a Villain or removal spell, then recast it cheaply.",
  "Discard outlets (no wheels): connive Villains, Faithless Looting, Frantic Search, Thrill of Possibility, Unexpected Windfall and Big Score (discard as a cost, make Treasures), Fable of the Mirror-Breaker, Shadow of the Goblin, Ultimate Green Goblin's upkeep discard, Green Goblin Revenant's attack, Pumpkin Bombardment.",
  "Cheap interaction: Deadly Rollick is free while Norman/Goblin is on the battlefield; Infernal Grasp, Terminate, Pumpkin Bombardment, Electro's Bolt, Bowmasters, Otawara, five counterspells. Sandman's Quicksand recast from the graveyard counts as paying mayhem, so it only shrinks opponents' creatures.",
  "Sinister Six core: Doctor Octopus, Master Planner (Villains +2/+2, refill to eight each end step), Doc Ock, Mysterio, Electro, Scorpion, Chameleon. Behold the Sinister Six! costs 5 when recast from the graveyard with Goblin.",
  "v3 swaps from v2: out Rhystic Study, Patchwork Banner, Madame Masque, Prison Break, Kindred Dominance, Unstable Experiment, 1 Island; in Opposition Agent, Unexpected Windfall, Big Score, Deadly Rollick, Infernal Grasp, Fellwar Stone, Otawara.",
  "Bracket 3 flags: Ultron + Prowler loop is bounded (each Robot costs {1}); never add Ashnod's Altar, Phyrexian Altar or Krark-Clan Ironworks. No Underworld Breach.",
  "Not simulated yet. Estimate: Goblin online turn 4-5; wins turn 7-9 at Bracket 3."
 ],
