   "label": "B2 power + Agent",
   "name": "Norman Osborn: Sinister Six (B2 power + Opposition Agent)",
   "notes": [
    "Opposition Agent stays in by request. It's a Game Changer, so this list is officially Bracket 3 with one Game Changer; everything else is Bracket 2 level. Cut it for Sign in Blood to make it true Bracket 2 again, or ask the table first (rule 0).",
    "Gifts Ungiven in for Negate. It's a four-mana instant tutor: name Ultron, Doctor Doom, Animate Dead and Behold the Sinister Six, and whatever lands in the graveyard is reanimation fuel or a mayhem recast. It doesn't trigger the Green Goblin recast, which only counts cards you discarded, so it's a good fit but not a core piece.",
    "Bowmasters and The One Ring are out. Murderous Rider and Night's Whisper replace them.",
    "Mana: the six fetch and shock lands are out so the land speed stays at Bracket 2 level. In: Terramorphic Expanse, Evolving Wilds, Xander's Lounge (UBR Triome) and one more basic of each color. Pain lands stay (Sulfurous Springs, Underground River, Shivan Reef).",
    "Bracket checks: no extra turns, no mass land denial, no two-card infinite combos. Ultron plus Prowler is still bounded (each Robot costs {1}). Don't add Ashnod's Altar, Phyrexian Altar, Krark-Clan Ironworks or Underworld Breach."
   ],
